<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-VIRENQUE WINS 14TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-VIRENQUE WINS 14TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>COURCHEVEL, France 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Richard Virenque of France won the 14th stage of the Tour de France over 148 kms from Alpe d'Huez on Sunday.</p>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
